  ~ Minab Beta v0.9.1 — About is short now (fix #1): only the
  ~ "Check for updates" button, its result RIGHT UNDER the button,
  ~ the app version, and Minab's own text (version + the extra
  ~ features vs similar apps). The upstream boilerplate (copyright
  ~ notices, OpenVPN / OpenVPN3 / OpenSSL versions, translators,
  ~ privacy policy, full license texts) is gone from this screen —
  ~ the v0.9 trim had only cut Minab's own text, so the screen was
  ~ still ~90% boilerplate. The thanks to ics-openvpn stays in
  ~ minab_about_text, and the full licenses stay in the source
  ~ repo (doc/LICENSE.txt, full_licenses.html in assets).
